[{"title":"寄题韩祠二首 其二","author":"谢元汴","text":"苍然古木龙螭姿，一水流寒照发眉。\n潮学于今称大雅，南州自此不侏㒧。\n华山恸哭真佳士，秦岭悲歌亦可儿。\n吊古许多词赋客，筮魂能解九京颐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":39024,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋归示懋章","author":"谢元汴","text":"依然故国未天涯，烟水云山共一家。\n偕隐我能希母尚，乐饥尔勿咄兄差。\n征帆瀰瀰逐轻羽，杨柳青青映白沙。\n笑傲沧波成小咏，舟人竞羡女牛车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":39025,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小筑落成题壁","author":"谢元汴","text":"文宁求鬼哭，石莫补天穿。\n自是奇人少，非关古圣骞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":39026,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秦王卷衣二首 其一","author":"谢元汴","text":"夜夜卷衣裳，非无颜与色。\n不似浣纱人，徒令倾人国。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":39027,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秦王卷衣二首 其二","author":"谢元汴","text":"长城万古利，志不在婵娟。\n魏武一代雄，未忘西陵田。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":39028,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望海三首 其一","author":"谢元汴","text":"奇负有难平，招招邛海水。\n毫毛吐蜃云，罗者视为雉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":39029,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望海三首 其二","author":"谢元汴","text":"天问地能答，水虫竞百戏。\n神奸载九鼎，三箧亡由记。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":39030,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望海三首 其三","author":"谢元汴","text":"九日浴枝下，上枝耀若许。\n鼋鼍不作梁，莫共仙人语。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":39031,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"骂蜘蛛三首 其一","author":"谢元汴","text":"尔腹诚便便，何如边孝先。\n侏儒饱欲死，笑我非臞仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":39032,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"骂蜘蛛三首 其二","author":"谢元汴","text":"顷刻丝纶就，其中藏杀机。\n吞啖类杞桧，何事集吾扉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":39033,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"骂蜘蛛三首 其三","author":"谢元汴","text":"尔肥非义胜，腴外而中枯。\n窘蠢栌间伏，居然五石瓠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":39034,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读吴越春秋吊西子","author":"谢元汴","text":"五云溪上浣纱漪，色剑当年恨黛眉。\n轻雾犹含双凤影，亡吴何独说西施。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":39035,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽吴长源十首 其一","author":"谢元汴","text":"牙缃绿管簇花新，绮阁朱栏浥细尘。\n自是丰城多剑气，天生神物会延津。","collection":"明","notice":"","proven